- $4 \times 5^4 = 4 \times 625 = 2500$
- $1 \times 5^3 = 1 \times 125 = 125$
- $3 \times 5^2 = 3 \times 25 = 75$
- $2 \times 5^1 = 2 \times 5 = 10$
- $4 \times 5^0 = 4 \times 1 = 4$

Add them all together:

$$
2500 + 125 + 75 + 10 + 4 = 2714
