So substituting a into the expression 2/a + 1/b, we get 2/(1 - 2b) + 1/b. Now, this becomes a function of b, say f(b) = 2/(1 - 2b) + 1/b. Now, I need to find the minimum of this function for 0 < b < 1/2.

