So from the constraint a + 2b = 1, substituting a = 2b gives 2b + 2b = 1 => 4b = 1 => b = 1/4, which is the same as before. Therefore, a = 2*(1/4) = 1/2. Then the expression is 2/(1/2) + 1/(1/4) = 4 + 4 = 8. So same result.

